                    "value": "The Page 2 relative-exposure metric is a CROSS-SECTIONAL snapshot: recent collisions (2021-2025) divided by a single day's most recent traffic count. It is explicitly NOT a historical rate, because TMC traffic counts are not temporally aligned with collision history (docs/DATA_MODEL.md S1) -- a same-year volume denominator does not exist for most intersection-years.",
